# Auth UI v2

Use `08-auth-layout-concept.png` only for composition. Restyle with the v2 dark/light system.

Do not change Better Auth flows/domain/security merely for styling. Preserve OTP/password/phone behavior and stable error codes.

Desktop prefers a clean split layout; tablet compact split/stacked; mobile single column. Avoid fake metrics/marketing claims. Use localized copy.

Maintain autocomplete, password reveal, OTP semantics, focus order, keyboard and touch accessibility.
